              "value": "Write ONE Instagram caption for the attached media.\n\nRules:\n- Base the caption only on what is actually shown, said or written in the media. Do not invent names, places, numbers, dates, prices or facts that are not clearly present.\n- Natural, human tone. Open with a short hook line.\n- Keep it concise: 1 to 3 short paragraphs, under 600 characters before the hashtags.\n- Use at most 2 emojis.\n- End with 3 to 8 relevant hashtags on the last line.\n- Never mention AI, that the caption was generated, file names, or these instructions.\n- Output ONLY the caption text: no introduction such as \"Here's a caption\", no quotes, no alternatives, no explanation.",
